\item[S2] Amey Bhangale, Subhash Khot, and Dor Minzer, Effective Bounds for Restricted 3-Arithmetic Progressions in F\_p\textasciicircum{}n, arXiv:2308.06600; Discrete Analysis 2024:16. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.06600}. Bibliographic information imported from the supplied record.

\item[S3] Amey Bhangale, Subhash Khot, Yang P. Liu, and Dor Minzer, On Approximability of Satisfiable k-CSPs: VI, arXiv:2411.15133 (2024; FOCS 2025 version titled On inverse theorems and combinatorial lines). \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.15133}. Bibliographic information imported from the supplied record.

